{"4033640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Delivery Survivors", "steam_appid": 4033640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Playtest 0.0.9c Update!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtest 0.0.9c is now officially live!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here’s what’s new and updated:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VFX Update</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller bug fixes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Feature (Saving, Achievement...)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The demo will be live on September 11!</strong></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033640/extras/8597c307c881d14d8e832ac5c9a88c44.poster.avif?t=1788016065\" width=64 height=48 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033640/extras/8597c307c881d14d8e832ac5c9a88c44.webm?t=1788016065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Delivery Survivors </strong>is a survivor-like action roguelite game. Gather powerful relics and weapons, level up your character, create unique builds and slaughter your way through endless minions and bosses in the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Delivery Survivors</strong> plays like a combination of <i>Brotato</i> and <i>Slay the Spire</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fallen halfway through the delivery? Don’t worry! The Delivery Guild has a wide range of couriers ready to take over the duty, and the knowledge gained from those who met their end will help you plan safer routes in your next attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During each delivery run, you can acquire and upgrade a variety of weapons, as well as collect special relics that influence the flow of the game helping you push back against endless waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033640/extras/04cf46b01044d942d053614d68059ca6.poster.avif?t=1788016065\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033640/extras/04cf46b01044d942d053614d68059ca6.webm?t=1788016065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033640/extras/04cf46b01044d942d053614d68059ca6.mp4?t=1788016065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire various weapons and relics to defeat hordes of monsters and bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge dungeons in a Vampire Survivors-like gameplay, strengthening yourself through wave after wave of battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the map, with each run offering a different experience.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033640/extras/8597c307c881d14d8e832ac5c9a88c44.poster.avif?t=1788016065\" width=64 height=48 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033640/extras/8597c307c881d14d8e832ac5c9a88c44.webm?t=1788016065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Delivery Survivors </strong>is a survivor-like action roguelite game. Gather powerful relics and weapons, level up your character, create unique builds and slaughter your way through endless minions and bosses in the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Delivery Survivors</strong> plays like a combination of <i>Brotato</i> and <i>Slay the Spire</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fallen halfway through the delivery? Don’t worry! The Delivery Guild has a wide range of couriers ready to take over the duty, and the knowledge gained from those who met their end will help you plan safer routes in your next attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During each delivery run, you can acquire and upgrade a variety of weapons, as well as collect special relics that influence the flow of the game helping you push back against endless waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033640/extras/04cf46b01044d942d053614d68059ca6.poster.avif?t=1788016065\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033640/extras/04cf46b01044d942d053614d68059ca6.webm?t=1788016065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033640/extras/04cf46b01044d942d053614d68059ca6.mp4?t=1788016065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire various weapons and relics to defeat hordes of monsters and bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge dungeons in a Vampire Survivors-like gameplay, strengthening yourself through wave after wave of battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the map, with each run offering a different experience.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Delivery Sur